        <mxCell id="c85" value="&lt;i&gt;Selected: D10, whose formula locks the FreightTerms column (bold) and leaves the sum column to be changed by hand: FreightMargin (column M) does not follow BillableFreightAmount (column K), because FreightTerms, a text column, sits between them, so a fill across fails in one column. Outlined: the Difference row, zero in every column, and the two SUBTOTAL cells. The slicer is on the Shipment Table, with Prepaid selected.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="374" width="860" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
